# RPG Maker MV collaboration settings

# Treat binary assets as non-mergeable.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ogg binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.rpgsave binary

# RPG Maker generated data is valid JSON but semantic merges are risky.
# Resolve these with the file owner when conflicts happen.
data/*.json text eol=lf
js/plugins.js text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
